        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cao Cao's Campaign</strong> is the predecessor to the <strong>Jiang Wei's Campaign</strong> game in the <strong>Magic Tower: Three Kingdoms Series</strong>, and the pre-predecessor to <strong>Chaos Across Time</strong>. Following <strong>Magic Tower: Three Kingdoms: Swallow the Earth</strong>, it serves as the inaugural title of this series. The game features a <strong>linear narrative with multiple choices and multiple endings</strong>.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4172330/extras/7b42dad9bae9cf62e1ad396345975adb.avif?t=1764813083\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, the player takes on the role of Jiang Wei's father (from the next generation's Jiang Wei's Campaign), set in an alternate historical background. The final boss is <strong>Cao Cao</strong>.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4172330/extras/22c5bbd2ea0f51282f581fe89314b675.avif?t=1764813083\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The chests in the starting area provide initial supplies and the <strong>General Tokens</strong> needed for immediate recruitment upon leaving. After this, recruiting generals requires giving them the corresponding quantity of <strong>different tiered General Tokens</strong>.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4172330/extras/f7cd5a41cabffd2646f67a93bd4958dd.avif?t=1764813083\" width=1282 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The type and quantity of <strong>General Tokens</strong> required to recruit a general will vary depending on that general's <strong>attribute values and abilities</strong>. New General Tokens can be obtained through subsequent quests and chests.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4172330/extras/2eb766fea9d6855928689b9bac8045d5.avif?t=1764813083\" width=1282 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game follows a <strong>linear scenario design</strong>. You must defeat the boss of the current stage to progress to the next one – for example, the Village Chief in the starter village.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4172330/extras/a655b0e500cf8d7140e79d3b66fee80b.avif?t=1764813083\" width=1282 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As it was developed earlier, the combat system <strong>lacks an acceleration/speed-up function</strong>. However, its <strong>gameplay and fun factor were still well-received</strong> among players who experienced it.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4172330/extras/310c352f0dd5ca3ecb064e78b5241398.avif?t=1764813083\" width=1282 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Since it's also quite old, many details are no longer clearly remembered. If you need a walkthrough, please follow the instructions on the official account <strong>&quot;Zhua Gou Li&quot;</strong> (search/input to join group) to join the game's WeChat group and discuss it with veteran players who have played it.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4172330/extras/18724896e9a87718d234cbd825072726.avif?t=1764813083\" width=1282 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of course, it would be even better if you could <strong>create a walkthrough</strong>. We will reward you with a <strong>100,000-point redemption code</strong> for any game in our catalog that you desire. We hope players will actively contribute!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This installment also features a <strong>maze</strong> just before reaching the main city, <strong>increasing the exploration difficulty</strong> because <strong>low-cost HP recovery is impossible within this area</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After all, it was completed/released back in <strong>2022</strong>, and too many details are forgotten. I'll stop writing here for now and may update the description later if I remember more.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cao Cao's Campaign</strong> is the predecessor to the <strong>Jiang Wei's Campaign</strong> game in the <strong>Magic Tower: Three Kingdoms Series</strong>, and the pre-predecessor to <strong>Chaos Across Time</strong>. Following <strong>Magic Tower: Three Kingdoms: Swallow the Earth</strong>, it serves as the inaugural title of this series. The game features a <strong>linear narrative with multiple choices and multiple endings</strong>.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4172330/extras/7b42dad9bae9cf62e1ad396345975adb.avif?t=1764813083\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, the player takes on the role of Jiang Wei's father (from the next generation's Jiang Wei's Campaign), set in an alternate historical background. The final boss is <strong>Cao Cao</strong>.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4172330/extras/22c5bbd2ea0f51282f581fe89314b675.avif?t=1764813083\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The chests in the starting area provide initial supplies and the <strong>General Tokens</strong> needed for immediate recruitment upon leaving. After this, recruiting generals requires giving them the corresponding quantity of <strong>different tiered General Tokens</strong>.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4172330/extras/f7cd5a41cabffd2646f67a93bd4958dd.avif?t=1764813083\" width=1282 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The type and quantity of <strong>General Tokens</strong> required to recruit a general will vary depending on that general's <strong>attribute values and abilities</strong>. New General Tokens can be obtained through subsequent quests and chests.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4172330/extras/2eb766fea9d6855928689b9bac8045d5.avif?t=1764813083\" width=1282 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game follows a <strong>linear scenario design</strong>. You must defeat the boss of the current stage to progress to the next one – for example, the Village Chief in the starter village.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4172330/extras/a655b0e500cf8d7140e79d3b66fee80b.avif?t=1764813083\" width=1282 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As it was developed earlier, the combat system <strong>lacks an acceleration/speed-up function</strong>. However, its <strong>gameplay and fun factor were still well-received</strong> among players who experienced it.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4172330/extras/310c352f0dd5ca3ecb064e78b5241398.avif?t=1764813083\" width=1282 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Since it's also quite old, many details are no longer clearly remembered. If you need a walkthrough, please follow the instructions on the official account <strong>&quot;Zhua Gou Li&quot;</strong> (search/input to join group) to join the game's WeChat group and discuss it with veteran players who have played it.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4172330/extras/18724896e9a87718d234cbd825072726.avif?t=1764813083\" width=1282 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of course, it would be even better if you could <strong>create a walkthrough</strong>. We will reward you with a <strong>100,000-point redemption code</strong> for any game in our catalog that you desire. We hope players will actively contribute!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This installment also features a <strong>maze</strong> just before reaching the main city, <strong>increasing the exploration difficulty</strong> because <strong>low-cost HP recovery is impossible within this area</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After all, it was completed/released back in <strong>2022</strong>, and too many details are forgotten. I'll stop writing here for now and may update the description later if I remember more.</p>",
